# An allowlist, because of what the two excluded things cost. `.env` and `.env.<event>` must never
# reach a layer — secrets arrive by `--env-file` at run time (ADR-0008) — and an allowlist means a
# later `COPY` cannot widen onto one by accident. `.git/`, `.cache/` and `state/` are the rest of
# this repository by volume, and none of it is the image's business.
*
!solver

# Byte-compiled leftovers of whatever interpreter last ran on the host — not the one in the image.
solver/**/__pycache__
